  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "41A183A20EE70831",
      "text": "Motiti ♪ Motiti ♪ Motiti ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "32422C00E4F946BF",
      "text": "... Je vois que tu as réussi à te débarrasser\\nde la garde. Parfait.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "32422D00E4F94872",
      "text": "Tu t’apprêtes à entrer dans le repaire\\nde l’équipe Fée de la Team Star...\\r\\nLe Groupe Ruchbah.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "32422E00E4F94A25",
      "text": "Son boss s’appelle Ortiga.\\nC’est le mécano de l’organisation.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "32422700E4F93E40",
      "text": "C’est le plus jeune parmi les boss, mais il ne faut\\npas le sous-estimer : il est redoutable.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "32422800E4F93FF3",
      "text": "En général, il a tendance à donner des ordres\\naux autres plutôt que d’agir en personne.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "32422900E4F941A6",
      "text": "Mais il en faut peu pour qu’il se vexe\\net qu’il engage lui-même le combat.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "32422A00E4F94359",
      "text": "La meilleure stratégie est donc de te débarrasser\\nd’un maximum de ses Sbires jusqu’à ce qu’il sorte.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "32423300E4F952A4",
      "text": "Continue de les battre un à un, et Ortiga finira\\nbien par se montrer.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_09",
